          "text": "Swamiye Saranam (an emotional Bhajan in Malayalam)\nWhenever  I sing or hear   this prayer   tears of joy   fill  my eyes  as I have been lucky enough to chant it .Those who do not know Malayalam   can read my  translation and have the same feeling .What a\ngreat stotra, Ayyappa"
